  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 3ff6acaa8b9f1994499dd387e6188532, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  Comments: This scene demonstrates the full range of property types that Timeflow
    supports and can animate. PropertyTestA animates each property, and PropertyTestB
    demonstrates the use of channel links to those values.
  Warning: Please note that value conversions do occur with some types and precision
    may be lost. For example, Timeflow does not natively support double precision
    and values are converted to float for processing. Since double precision is only
    needed in special circumstances, this was an optimization decided early on to
    reduce serialization costs, particularly with keyframe objects. This is something
    that could be addressed by extending keyframes with custom data, however is not
    currently implemented and may be a feature considered for the future.
  URLTitle: Channel Link Documentation
  URL: https://axongenesis.gitbook.io/timeflow/user-guide/timeflow-view/channel-link
  URL2Title: Properties Documentation
  URL2: https://axongenesis.gitbook.io/timeflow/user-guide/timeflow-view/properties
